&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Clearly document and communicate your work to senior engineers and technical leads&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
