&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Create and manage engineering changes for updates and improvements to existing products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
