&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 26, 29);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;**This is a part time role with contracted weekly hours to fall between 14 to 22 hours; actual amount will depend on your availability**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 26, 29);&quot;&gt;As a Peloton Expert, you aren&#39;t just selling equipment; you are a consultant for a lifestyle transformation. You are the heartbeat of our retail showrooms—engaging, goal-oriented, and deeply passionate about the intersection of fitness and technology.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 26, 29);&quot;&gt;Our Experts are high-energy business drivers who thrive in a face-to-face sales environment. You are a master of &quot;The Consult,&quot; possessing the ability to identify a member&#39;s unique wellness goals and connect them with the hardware and content that will change their life. By building authentic, long-lasting relationships, you serve as a brand ambassador who turns curious prospects into dedicated members of the Peloton community.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 26, 29);&quot;&gt;YOUR DAILY IMPACT AT PELOTON&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You engage with the varied traffic we see in our retail stores. From lightly curious introductions to the repeat visitors who haven’t yet committed - you will know how to start a conversation with anyone who so much as looks at us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Achieve and exceed individual sales targets by executing high-touch, face-to-face consultations and product demonstrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive individual sales results by treating every showroom visitor as a VIP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maximise sales through personalised service, deep product storytelling, and maintaining a premium showroom environment that reflects our brand’s fitness-forward aesthetic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively manage your &quot;book of business&quot; using Salesforce to track lead preferences, follow up on trials, and convert prospects into sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execute strategic phone and email outreach to both new leads and existing members to communicate product launches, community events, and post-purchase follow-ups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on Peloton’s evolving software, boutique apparel, and diverse fitness content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work seamlessly with your team of fellow sales specialists to ensure every visitor receives a world-class experience, while maintaining impeccable visual and physical store standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
