&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience in a face-to-face retail or hospitality environment. Experience in fitness, wellness, technology or premium lifestyle brands is a major plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;An entrepreneurial spirit with a track record of meeting and exceeding KPIs and sales goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;An enthusiastic, engaging, and polished demeanor—you know how to &quot;own the room&quot; and inspire others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A genuine passion for health, wellness, and the Peloton mission. You understand the dedication it takes to maintain a balanced lifestyle and can speak authentically to it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
