&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 6+ years specific to Indirect Procurement such as Logistics/Transportation, Marketing, Technology categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant education or equivalent work experience in Business, Economics, Supply Chain Management or a related field of study&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and maintain productive working relationships, set goals, resolve problems, and make decisions that improve organizational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly results-oriented with a successful record of accomplishments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal, written, and verbal communication skills - the ability to understand and clearly communicate complex topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to respond to evolving requirements and multifaceted priorities in a fast-paced project environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should have the ability to balance multiple projects at various phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both tactically and strategically in a team-oriented, collaborative environment to meet the needs of the business&lt;/li&gt;
