&lt;p&gt;Peloton is looking for a Senior Executive Assistant to serve as a strategic partner to our leadership team at our NY Headquarters. This isn’t just about managing a calendar; it’s about being a diligent, high-energy communicator who thrives in a fast-paced environment. We need a resourceful problem-solver and relationship builder who brings a &quot;can-do&quot; attitude and a genuine desire to evolve with a global brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY IMPACT AT PELOTON&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
